B. INTEGRATION-BRANCH LITERAL GATE  (informational — pre-existing red, NOT this surface)
==============================================================================
The prompt's literal gate runs the whole TeslaSync / TeslaSync-macOS schemes.
This working tree is the fully-merged integration branch (HEAD is a chain of
`merge(parallel)` commits pulling in every slot's surfaces at once). That merge
puts THREE independent base conventions for the dashboard registry types — plus
all 15 sibling `dashboard-widgets/*` widgets — into one module, and colocates each
slot's XCTest files inside the app-target source roots. Both conditions break the
whole-scheme build BEFORE this surface is even reached, and BOTH are outside this
prompt's allowed file scope (ClimateHistoryWidget.* only).

